# Scratch
ERC_test_app/

# Three rules were removed from this file. Recorded here because each was
# actively harmful rather than merely stale:
#
#   *ERC.net.sln
#       Ignored the solution file. Git on Windows matches ignore rules case
#       insensitively by default, so this also swallowed "ERC.Net.sln" - the file
#       the test suite uses to locate the repository root. Committing with this in
#       place produced a clone whose tests could not find the repository they were
#       in.
#
#   D:\Source\Repos\ERC_net\ERC.net\ERC_test_app
#       An absolute path from one machine. Ignore patterns are relative to the
#       repository, so this matched nothing on any machine, including that one.
#
#   ERC\obj\ERC.Net.csproj.nuget.cache
#       A single generated file inside obj, while obj itself was not ignored - so
#       the rest of the build output was tracked.
